{:edb/db-before-t 1750 :edb/db-after-t 1751 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535063 50 #inst "2026-10-08T15:59:28.119Z" 13194139535063 true] [17592186064147 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329195 13194139535063 true] [17592186064147 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329201 13194139535063 true] [17592186064147 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329233 13194139535063 true] [17592186064148 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329206 13194139535063 true] [17592186064148 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329212 13194139535063 true] [17592186064148 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329240 13194139535063 true] [17592186064148 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329247 13194139535063 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329188 13194139535063 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329215 13194139535063 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329220 13194139535063 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329226 13194139535063 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186329254 13194139535063 true] [17592186329188 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329189 13194139535063 true] [17592186329188 1089 "q-114896" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329188 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535063 true] [17592186329188 1100 "${\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\frac{2x+1}{6x+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329188 1113 #uuid "9cb05493-3a43-5cd7-9456-a6491428f397" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329188 1145 "First, we pull out the factor of $6$ from the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\frac{2x+1}{6x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\frac{2x+1}{6(x+\\frac{1}{6})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\frac{2x+1}{(x+\\frac{1}{6})}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we draw up our synthetic division table to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & x & {x}^{0} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{6} & 2 & 1 \\\\  & ↓ & -\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & 2 & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2x+1}{(x+\\frac{1}{6})} & =2+\\frac{(\\frac{2}{3})}{(x+\\frac{1}{6})} \\\\  & =2+\\frac{4}{6x+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\frac{2x+1}{6x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{6}{\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}(2+\\frac{4}{6x+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[2{\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\text{d}x+4{\\int }_{-1/12}^{0}\\frac{1}{6x+1}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{[2x+\\frac{4}{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|6x+1|]}_{-1/12}^{0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{[2x+\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|6x+1|]}_{-1/12}^{0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[2(0-(-\\frac{1}{12}))+\\frac{2}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|6(0)+1|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|6(-\\frac{1}{12})+1|)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[2(\\frac{1}{12})+\\frac{2}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡1-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{2}))] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}(1+4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329190 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329191 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329192 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329193 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329194 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1041 "selection" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329194 13194139535063 true] [17592186329189 1110 #uuid "edbb6eef-4442-5b15-8560-cfa9b2fce45e" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329190 1034 "\\frac{1}{36}(1+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329190 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329190 1111 #uuid "dc457955-dab3-5ba4-8f77-192fa422c9b8" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329191 1034 "\\frac{1}{16}(3+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329191 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329191 1111 #uuid "bb9339b1-122b-59d1-8567-006b41ab76e6" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329192 1034 "\\frac{1}{16}(1+5\\operatorname{ln}⁡