16-23(\\operatorname{ln}⁡7-\\operatorname{ln}⁡5) \\\\  & =16-23\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\,\\frac{7}{5}\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329197 13194139535063 true] [17592186329196 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329198 13194139535063 true] [17592186329196 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329196 1041 "field-1" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329196 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329197 13194139535063 true] [17592186329196 1110 #uuid "54f57a12-9bed-5b83-bc99-22e551a8f2dd" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329197 1034 "16" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329197 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329197 1111 #uuid "d79c989b-6593-5652-8d35-7984dcc4d651" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329198 1034 "32" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329198 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329198 1111 #uuid "48af1386-88ba-5186-b23c-fc6da9ac5045" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329200 13194139535063 true] [17592186329199 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329199 1041 "field-2" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329199 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329200 13194139535063 true] [17592186329199 1110 #uuid "d2254b8e-e025-5f34-bb1b-88840799d44e" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329200 1034 "\\frac{7}{5}" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329200 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329200 1111 #uuid "a9a6fd3e-be42-5fa6-b11c-40399135f34f" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329202 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329204 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1089 "q-352220" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1100 "Evaluate the following integral:\n\n${\\int }_{-1}^{2}\\frac{9x+7}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}} $-\\,29\\operatorname{ln}⁡(${{field-2}}$)$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1113 #uuid "f3bfb7fe-e8c7-55e0-8fa0-25b966f35697" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329201 1145 "The denominator of the integrand doesn't divide the numerator exactly, so we need to decompose it into its quotient and remainder. For this, we can use synthetic division.\n\nWe start by drawing up our synthetic division table:\n\n|  | ${x}^{1}$ | ${x}^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $-4$ | $9$ | $7$ |\n|  | $↓$ | $-36$ |\n|  | $9$ | $-29$ |\n\nSo, from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{9x+7}{x+4}=9-\\frac{29}{x+4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{2}\\frac{9x+7}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-1}^{2}(9-\\frac{29}{x+4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =9{\\int }_{-1}^{2}\\text{d}x-29{\\int }_{-1}^{2}\\frac{1}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =9x\\,{|}_{-1}^{2}-29\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+4|\\,{|}_{-1}^{2} \\\\  & =9(2-(-1))-29(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2+4|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|-1+4|) \\\\  & =27-29(\\operatorname{ln}⁡6-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3) \\\\  & =27-29\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{6}{3}) \\\\  & =27-29\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\,2\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329202 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329203 13194139535063 true] [17592186329202 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329202 1041 "field-1" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329202 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329203 13194139535063 true] [17592186329202 1110 #uuid "8c49b648-fb1f-5e74-9030-5004cd410fe7" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329203 1034 "27" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329203 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329203 1111 #uuid "4a8d662c-a28d-5dfd-9f84-bd201ce8da28" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329204 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329205 13194139535063 true] [17592186329204 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329204 1041 "field-2" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329204 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329205 13194139535063 true] [17592186329204 1110 #uuid "2c6b66ef-9248-517c-bd70-4a8da2f2b42d" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329205 1034 "2" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329205 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329205 1111 #uuid "cb8bc45e-9e88-508e-9118-f6d3b447c114" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329207 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329210 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1089 "q-352246" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1100 "Evaluate the following integral:\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{2}+8x+7}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}} $-\\,9\\operatorname{ln}⁡(${{field-2}}$)$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1113 #uuid "72030db9-28d9-5270-aae9-585679ac8d61" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329206 1145 "The denominator of the integrand doesn't divide the numerator exactly, so we need to decompose it into its quotient and remainder. For this, we can use synthetic division.\n\nWe start by drawing up our synthetic division table:\n\n|  | ${x}^{2}$ | ${x}^{1}$ | ${x}^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $-4$ | $1$ | $8$ | $7$ |\n|  | $↓$ | $-4$ | $-16$ |\n|  | $1$ | $4$ | $-9$ |\n\nSo, from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}+8x+7}{x+4}=x+4-\\frac{9}{x+4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{2}+8x+7}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}(x+4-\\frac{9}{x+4})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}x\\,\\text{d}x+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\text{d}x-9{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{x+4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,{|}_{0}^{3}+4x\\,{|}_{0}^{3}-9\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+4|\\,{|}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({3}^{2}-{0}^{2})+4(3-0)-9(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3+4|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|0+4|) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}+12-9(\\operatorname{ln}⁡7-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4) \\\\  & =\\frac{33}{2}-9\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\,\\frac{7}{4}\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329208 13194139535063 true] [17592186329207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329209 13194139535063 true] [17592186329207 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329207 1041 "field-1" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329207 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329209 13194139535063 true] [17592186329207 1110 #uuid "e8f13992-7cd8-53d4-bc5f-ebe64335c164" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329208 1034 "\\frac{9}{2}" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329208 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329208 1111 #uuid "ba322277-f833-5b0f-b6ff-1b153f0ed981" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329209 1034 "\\frac{33}{2}" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329209 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329209 1111 #uuid "7b08c6d1-b0ef-5251-8fcd-8130d4bd8ff7" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329210 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329211 13194139535063 true] [17592186329210 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329210 1041 "field-2" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329210 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329211 13194139535063 true] [17592186329210 1110 #uuid "08551bad-3dfc-5628-ac2b-6fb8af17a13a" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329211 1034 "\\frac{7}{4}" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329211 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329211 1111 #uuid "68d838cc-4447-5437-91aa-e0933b13b858" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329212 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329213 13194139535063 true] [17592186329212 1089 "q-352247" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329212 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535063 true] [17592186329212 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{3{x}^{3}-7{x}^{2}+5x-1}{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329212 1113 #uuid "be9ad5b5-e9ad-553d-b5f1-2e80ee4b4ad4" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329212 1145 "We first need to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder parts, which we can do using synthetic division.\n\nWe draw up a synthetic division table:\n\n|  | ${x}^{3}$ | ${x}^{2}$ | ${x}^{1}$ | ${x}^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $1$ | $3$ | $-7$ | $5$ | $-1$ |\n|  | $↓$ | $3$ | $-4$ | $1$ |\n|  | $3$ | $-4$ | $1$ | $0$ |\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{3{x}^{3}-7{x}^{2}+5x-1}{x-1}=3{x}^{2}-4x+1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{3{x}^{3}-7{x}^{2}+5x-1}{x-1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}(3{x}^{2}-4x+1)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x-4{\\int }_{1}^{2}x\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}{|}_{1}^{2}-4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}{|}_{1}^{2}+x{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & ={x}^{3}{|}_{1}^{2}-2{x}^{2}{|}_{1}^{2}+x{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =[{2}^{3}-{1}^{3}]-2[{2}^{2}-{1}^{2}]+[2-1] \\\\  & =7\\cdot 1-2(3)+1 \\\\  & =7-6+1 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329213 1000 #edb/ref 17592186329214 13194139535063 true] [17592186329213 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535063 true] [17592186329213 1041 "field-1" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329213 1104 #edb/ref 17592186329214 13194139535063 true] [17592186329213 1110 #uuid "a4889729-35b6-598a-81ae-72b11a53eaa5" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329214 1034 "2" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329214 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535063 true] [17592186329214 1111 #uuid "bacdac22-7c6b-5b85-b2f1-d72f1101efe9" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329216 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1017 #edb/ref 17592186329218 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1089 "q-358835" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1100 "Evaluate the following integral:\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{5x-3}{2x+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}} $-\\,\\frac{11}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡($\n{{field-2}} $)$" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1113 #uuid "22bd6b2f-502e-5ce3-99ef-deb51dae08a3" 13194139535063 true] [17592186329215 1145 "First, we pull out the factor of $2$ from the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{5x-3}{2x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{5x-3}{2(x+1/2)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{5x-3}{(x+1/2)}\\,\\text